  "text": "Planning Document: Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 7 Stanmore South\n\nClause 9.7.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and encourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.7.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect the identified Heritage Items within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.7.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain distinctly single storey streetscapes that exist within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.7.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect groups or runs of buildings which retain their original form including roof forms, original detailing and finishes.\n\nClause 9.7.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect significant streetscapes and/or public domain elements within the precinct including landscaping, fencing, open space, sandstone kerbing and guttering, views and vistas and prevailing subdivision patterns.\n\nClause 9.7.2 - other (land_use_zoning): To preserve the mixed density residential character of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.7.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure that the provision and location of off-street car parking does not adversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.7.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect the identified values of the Kingston South Heritage Conservation Area.\n\n",
